  Actual decoder initialization in fixtures/av1/default_cdf.bin, regenerated
  and compared using unchanged primary functions. Encoder CDF is distinct.
  Copyright 2020 Advanced Micro Devices, Inc.
  SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
  The full Mesa MIT permission/disclaimer above applies to this derived data.

AV1 encoder default CDF (fixtures/vcn5/av1_encode/cdf.bin) derives from Mesa26.2.4 src/amd/common/ac_vcn_enc_av1_default_cdf.h, distributed with Mesa's AMD MIT encoder sources and the full AMD permission notice above. Encoder packets and CPU sequence header adapt src/gallium/drivers/radeonsi/mm/radeon_vcn_enc*.c and radeon_bitstream.c under the same notice. Original libaom-produced frame OBUs and source pixels were generated for this repository; no reference movie bytes are copied.
